# Destination is extensionless on purpose: Cloudflare Pages' own .html-stripping
# canonicalization redirects (308) any rewrite target that literally ends in .html,
# discarding the wildcard match entirely (confirmed live 2026-09-29: /t/<id> -> /ticket,
# losing <id>). Pointing at the already-clean path avoids that second redirect.
/t/*  /ticket  200
